### NOTE For OLSRT v1.3.1 (Wave 1 Stabilization)

Stabilization release on top of v1.3.0 (Atom).

### Fixed

- Actor (`ol_actor.c`):
  - Removed `pending_asks` hashmap leak in `ol_actor_ask`
  - Replaced busy-wait in `ol_actor_send_timeout` with cond_wait_until
  - Use `__atomic_load_n` / `__atomic_store_n` in mailbox lock-free ring buffer
  - Fixed heap-use-after-free in `ol_actor_ask` error path
  - `ol_actor_try_send` now falls back to the overflow list

- Actor arena (`ol_actor_arena.c`):
  - `ol_arena_free` validates pointer ownership before touching the header

- Supervisor (`ol_supervisor.c`):
  - Bounded shutdown timeout; stuck children no longer block teardown
  - Added `shutdown_timeout_ms`, `arena_size`, and `ol_supervisor_stats_t`

- Green threads (`ol_green_threads.{c,h}`):
  - Header and source structs are now consistent
  - Fixed negative-size padding bug on 64-bit
  - NUMA support is optional via `__has_include(<numa.h>)`

- Build:
  - Restored missing `src/code/streams/ol_actor_hashmap.c`

### Verified

- ASan + UBSan: clean
- TSan: clean
- Regression tests: 22 assertions, all passing
- Demo 01 (`demos/01_hello_actor.c`): working

### Known issues (Wave 2)

- The actor main loop is not yet driven by the green-thread scheduler;
  mailbox must be pumped manually via `ol_actor_process_batch()`.
- LSan is disabled in `verify.py` because of the above.
